"This install has no get-task-allow, so iOS will refuse JIT. Reinstall with a development certificate, as SideStore, AltStore or Sideloadly use. Distribution certificates cannot carry it." = "此安装没有 get-task-allow，因此 iOS 会拒绝 JIT。请使用开发证书重新安装，例如 SideStore、AltStore 或 Sideloadly 所用的证书。分发证书无法包含它。";
"Waiting for JIT.\nEnable it for Xenra in StikDebug, then come back. The game starts by itself." = "正在等待 JIT。\n请在 StikDebug 中为 Xenra 启用，然后返回。游戏会自动开始。";

