"2. Register your console" = "2. 注册主机";
"3. Create your gamertag" = "3. 创建你的玩家代号";
"Boot Setup Assistant" = "启动设置助手";
"Boot to dashboard" = "启动仪表板";
"Clear all steps" = "清除所有步骤";
"Clear setup progress?" = "清除设置进度？";
