"Could not open the EEPROM: %@" = "无法打开 EEPROM：%@";
"Could not save the EEPROM: %@" = "无法保存 EEPROM：%@";
"Could not start the Setup Assistant." = "无法启动设置助手。";
"Download Insignia-Setup.iso from the Setup Assistant download page. Import it below, boot it, then press Register." = "从设置助手下载页面下载 Insignia-Setup.iso。在下方导入、启动它，然后按“注册”。";
"Enter your email on insignia.live to get a code. Then boot the dashboard, choose Xbox Live, and sign up.\n\nWhen it asks for card details, use 4111 1111 1111 1111 — Insignia does not collect them. Use the same email you requested the code with." = "在 insignia.live 输入你的电子邮箱以获取验证码。然后启动仪表板，选择 Xbox Live 并注册。\n\n当它要求填写银行卡信息时，请使用 4111 1111 1111 1111 — Insignia 不会收集这些信息。请使用申请验证码时的同一邮箱。";
"Get ready" = "准备好";
"I signed up" = "我已注册";
"Import Insignia-Setup.iso" = "导入 Insignia-Setup.iso";
"Import a different file" = "导入其他文件";
"Insignia DNS was already set." = "Insignia DNS 已经设置。";
"Insignia DNS written. Restart emulation for it to take effect." = "已写入 Insignia DNS。请重启模拟使其生效。";
"Networking is on, but the DNS still needs writing. Launch any game once to create the EEPROM, then tap again." = "网络已开启，但 DNS 尚未写入。先启动任意游戏一次以创建 EEPROM，然后再次点击。";
"No EEPROM yet. Launch any game once to create it, then come back." = "还没有 EEPROM。先启动任意游戏一次以创建它，然后回来。";
"No app available to open web links." = "没有可用于打开网页链接的应用。";
"Open download page" = "打开下载页面";
"Play online again" = "再次在线游玩";
"Powered by Insignia" = "由 Insignia 提供";
"Read the full guide" = "阅读完整指南";
"Request a code" = "申请验证码";
"Run setup again" = "重新执行设置";
"Setup progress cleared." = "已清除设置进度。";
"The EEPROM file is not 256 bytes, so it cannot be edited." = "EEPROM 文件不是 256 字节，无法编辑。";
"This console is set up for Insignia. Launch a game that supports Xbox Live and sign in from its menu." = "此主机已为 Insignia 设置完成。启动支持 Xbox Live 的游戏并从其菜单登录。";
"This unchecks every step so you can start over. It does not undo the DNS already written to your console, and it will not delete your Insignia account." = "这会取消勾选所有步骤，以便重新开始。它不会撤销已写入主机的 DNS，也不会删除你的 Insignia 账户。";
"Turns on networking and points your console at Insignia's servers. Nothing to choose — just tap it.\n\nYour console also needs the final Xbox dashboard (version D:1.00.5960.01). On an older dashboard the steps below all appear to work, but signing in from a game will fail." = "开启网络并把主机指向 Insignia 的服务器。无需选择——点击即可。\n\n你的主机还需要最终的 Xbox 仪表板（版本 D:1.00.5960.01）。在较旧的仪表板上，下面的步骤看似有效，但从游戏登录会失败。";
"XBOX LIVE" = "XBOX LIVE";
"Xbox Live for the original Xbox was shut down in 2010. Insignia is a free, fan-run service that brings it back — online matches, friends and leaderboards in the games that supported them.\n\nIt takes about five minutes to set up. You only have to do this once." = "初代 Xbox 的 Xbox Live 已于 2010 年关闭。Insignia 是一项由爱好者运营的免费服务，让它重获新生——在曾支持它的游戏中提供在线对战、好友和排行榜。\n\n设置大约需要五分钟。只需做一次。";
"You're all set" = "一切就绪";
"unknown error" = "未知错误";
